    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/735e7a7a9dc19d319f86f32085c4273a.poster.avif?t=1711017686\" width=598 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/735e7a7a9dc19d319f86f32085c4273a.webm?t=1711017686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/735e7a7a9dc19d319f86f32085c4273a.mp4?t=1711017686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Piccadilly and her delightful friends on an enchanting journey through a museum unlike any other. Get ready to immerse yourself in a world of wonder, creativity, and jigsaw puzzles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/843ca4dc27f346fe8d87a9d1f8cfc2e4.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 A Gallery of Imagination \ud83c\udfa8</strong><br>Step into the captivating world of <strong>&quot;Piccadilly and her Magical World&quot;</strong> Children's Picture Book Series. Explore a museum bursting with art, characters, and captions straight from the heartwarming pages of this award-winning series. Every puzzle piece tells a story, inviting you to embark on an artistic adventure like no other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/ad148131298ecf403fa0e1c9e8e2e9ad.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 A Symphony of Sound \ud83c\udfb5</strong><br>Feel the magic of <strong>Piccadilly's Puzzle Museum</strong> come to life with an original full-length soundtrack. Immerse yourself in a symphony of melodies that complement the beauty of each puzzle, creating an enchanting atmosphere that will transport you to a world of imagination and wonder.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/3e09b67f628d61b150cdd9e39f024061.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83e\udde9 48 Puzzles, Countless Challenges \ud83e\udde9</strong><br>Get ready to test your wits and unleash your inner puzzle enthusiast! <strong>Piccadilly's Puzzle Museum</strong> offers 48 crafted puzzles based on 12 different full-color illustrations. Each puzzle comes in four difficulty levels, ensuring there's a challenge for everyone. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned puzzler, you'll find the perfect level to suit your skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/d69c05e3e2617223c9c8d3b428eb851b.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Hours of Joyful Exploration \ud83c\udf1f</strong><br>Get lost in the mesmerizing world of puzzles with Piccadilly and her friends. Spend hours of delightful exploration as you piece together these stunning illustrations. From whimsical characters to breathtaking landscapes, each puzzle is a work of art waiting for you to uncover its secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/ab99240e6a5100804a98526ae03ad946.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f No Hidden Costs, No Limits \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f</strong><br>We believe in providing an exceptional gaming experience without any strings attached. With Piccadilly's Puzzle Museum, there are no additional purchases required to complete the entire museum. Enjoy all the puzzles and features to your heart's content, without any interruptions.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/735e7a7a9dc19d319f86f32085c4273a.poster.avif?t=1711017686\" width=598 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/735e7a7a9dc19d319f86f32085c4273a.webm?t=1711017686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/735e7a7a9dc19d319f86f32085c4273a.mp4?t=1711017686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Piccadilly and her delightful friends on an enchanting journey through a museum unlike any other. Get ready to immerse yourself in a world of wonder, creativity, and jigsaw puzzles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/843ca4dc27f346fe8d87a9d1f8cfc2e4.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 A Gallery of Imagination \ud83c\udfa8</strong><br>Step into the captivating world of <strong>&quot;Piccadilly and her Magical World&quot;</strong> Children's Picture Book Series. Explore a museum bursting with art, characters, and captions straight from the heartwarming pages of this award-winning series. Every puzzle piece tells a story, inviting you to embark on an artistic adventure like no other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/ad148131298ecf403fa0e1c9e8e2e9ad.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 A Symphony of Sound \ud83c\udfb5</strong><br>Feel the magic of <strong>Piccadilly's Puzzle Museum</strong> come to life with an original full-length soundtrack. Immerse yourself in a symphony of melodies that complement the beauty of each puzzle, creating an enchanting atmosphere that will transport you to a world of imagination and wonder.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/3e09b67f628d61b150cdd9e39f024061.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83e\udde9 48 Puzzles, Countless Challenges \ud83e\udde9</strong><br>Get ready to test your wits and unleash your inner puzzle enthusiast! <strong>Piccadilly's Puzzle Museum</strong> offers 48 crafted puzzles based on 12 different full-color illustrations. Each puzzle comes in four difficulty levels, ensuring there's a challenge for everyone. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned puzzler, you'll find the perfect level to suit your skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/d69c05e3e2617223c9c8d3b428eb851b.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Hours of Joyful Exploration \ud83c\udf1f</strong><br>Get lost in the mesmerizing world of puzzles with Piccadilly and her friends. Spend hours of delightful exploration as you piece together these stunning illustrations. From whimsical characters to breathtaking landscapes, each puzzle is a work of art waiting for you to uncover its secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749730/extras/ab99240e6a5100804a98526ae03ad946.avif?t=1711017686\" width=600 height=158 /></span><br><strong>\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f No Hidden Costs, No Limits \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f</strong><br>We believe in providing an exceptional gaming experience without any strings attached. With Piccadilly's Puzzle Museum, there are no additional purchases required to complete the entire museum. Enjoy all the puzzles and features to your heart's content, without any interruptions.",
